- Call businesses
- Manage profile
- Manage notifications

Cannot:

- Approve businesses
- Moderate other users
- Delete other users' reviews
- Modify platform settings
- Access private information of other students

---

## SHOP OWNER

Can:

- Register
- Login
- Create business
- Submit business for verification
- Manage business profile
- Manage services
- Manage prices
- Manage opening hours
- Upload business photos
- Create offers
- View reviews
