- Approve their own verification
- Access platform administration

---

## PLATFORM ADMIN

Can:

- Manage users
- Manage businesses
- Verify businesses
- Approve/reject listings
- Suspend businesses
- Suspend users
- Moderate reviews
- Handle reports
- Manage categories
- Manage colleges
- Manage campuses
- View platform analytics
- Manage offers
