# 70. GIT DISCIPLINE

Make focused changes.

Use meaningful commit messages such as:

```text
feat(auth): add student registration
feat(business): add business verification workflow
feat(review): add structured category ratings
fix(auth): prevent expired token reuse
```

Do not combine unrelated features into one massive change.

