# 74. "MONEY ONLY MOVES WHEN THE JOB IS DONE RIGHT"

Treat this as a future marketplace principle.

Potential future flow:

```text
Student books
      ↓
Payment
      ↓
Service
      ↓
Completion confirmation
      ↓
Settlement
```

Disputes:

```text
Dispute
→ evidence
→ review
→ resolution
→ refund / partial refund / settlement
```

Do not advertise an unconditional money-back guarantee without implementing and legally reviewing the actual policy.

